                    <div class="o_avea_workspace_hero o_avea_stock_product_quick_hero">
                        <div class="o_avea_workspace_hero_intro">
                            <span class="o_avea_workspace_eyebrow">Stock</span>
                            <h2 class="o_avea_workspace_title">New Stock Item</h2>
                            <p class="o_avea_workspace_section_subtitle">
                                Quick add for Receive Stock — fill in the basics now, complete the rest later in Stock.
